<deviceset name="FT2232HQ" prefix="U" uservalue="yes">
<description>&lt;b&gt;FTDI FT2232HQ Dual USB-UART/MPSSE Bridge&lt;/b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Channel A = plain UART bridge to FPGA (TXD/RXD). Channel B = MPSSE JTAG to FPGA (BDBUS0-3 = TCK/TDI/TDO/TMS). Pin numbers verified from FTDI DS_FT2232H.pdf.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
