<text x="160.08" y="237.94" size="1.397" layer="97">SPI flash sits on the FPGA's dedicated
master-SPI config pins: CCLK C11, FCS_B K19,
DQ0-3 on D18/D19/G18/F18. Read at power-up.

microSD runs the native 4-bit SD bus, not SPI:
CLK, CMD and DAT[3:0] on six bank-34 balls of
its own, so a card cannot touch the config bus.</text>
